### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@organizationId = 1

### Organization operational overview
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/organizations/{{organizationId}}/overview

### Ranked rooms requiring attention
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/organizations/{{organizationId}}/problem-rooms

### Alert history: LAST_24_HOURS, LAST_7_DAYS or LAST_30_DAYS
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/analytics/organizations/{{organizationId}}/history?period=LAST_7_DAYS
